    "updated_at": "2016-09-16T10:32:04Z",
    "body": "It seems that given https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1243#issuecomment-247564185 we might want to also make this work for shared workers after all. It would require an additional origin slot I think, or something better I have not thought of. All that is pending approval from Chrome so marking this red.\n",
